WEBVTT

00:02:00.630 --> 00:02:02.004
(Risas)

00:02:02.504 --> 00:02:04.824
Eu non tiña nin idea do que estaba a falar

00:02:04.847 --> 00:02:06.234
(Risas)

00:02:06.814 --> 00:02:09.079
Díxome: "Fai iso,
xa sabes, cos ollos,

00:02:09.079 --> 00:02:10.499
coma cando ligas cos homes."

00:02:10.506 --> 00:02:12.936
"O que?", pregunteille.

00:02:13.724 --> 00:02:15.474
"Xa sabes, entorna os ollos."

00:02:15.491 --> 00:02:17.281
E de verdade que o intentei.

00:02:17.324 --> 00:02:19.124
Asemellábase algo a isto.

00:02:19.173 --> 00:02:21.959
(Risas)

00:02:21.959 --> 00:02:24.369
Parecía que buscaba a Wally.

00:02:24.841 --> 00:02:27.637
(Risas)

00:02:28.847 --> 00:02:30.511
Existe un motivo para isto,